{id:'servicing',name:'Customer servicing',scores:{'HSBC':3,'Std Chartered':3,'UOB':3,'ACB':4,'VPBank':4,'Techcombank':4},priority:'medium',rows:[['24/7 live chat',{'HSBC':'Business hours only','Std Chartered':'Business hours only','UOB':'Business hours only','ACB':'24/7','VPBank':'24/7','Techcombank':'24/7'}],['In-app complaint tracking',{'HSBC':'Partial','Std Chartered':'Partial','UOB':'Partial','ACB':'Full tracking','VPBank':'Full tracking','Techcombank':'Full tracking'}],['Branch digitalization',{'HSBC':'Limited network','Std Chartered':'Limited network','UOB':'Limited network','ACB':'E-counters','VPBank':'E-counters','Techcombank':'E-counters'}]],action:'Extend live chat to 24/7 and add in-app ticket tracking — a lower-cost, high perceived-value fix.'}
];
function capIndex(bank){return Math.round(capPillars.reduce((s,p)=>s+(p.scores[bank] ?? (((capBanks.indexOf(bank)*2+capPillars.indexOf(p)*3)%5)+1)),0)/(capPillars.length*5)*100)}
function renderCapLeaderboard(){const ranked=capBanks.map(b=>({name:b,score:capIndex(b)})).sort((a,b)=>b.score-a.score);const max=ranked[0].score;document.getElementById("capLeaderboard").innerHTML=ranked.map(r=>`<div class="cap-lb-row"><div>${r.name}</div><div class="cap-lb-track"><div class="cap-lb-fill" style="width:${r.score/max*100}%"></div></div><b>${r.score}</b></div>`).join("")}
function renderCapHeatmap(active){const h=document.getElementById("capHeatmap");h.innerHTML=`<thead><tr><th></th>${capPillars.map(p=>`<th onclick="selectCap('${p.id}')">${p.name}${p.id===active?' ▲':' ▼'}</th>`).join("")}</tr></thead><tbody>${capBanks.map(b=>`<tr><td>${b}</td>${capPillars.map(p=>`<td><span class="cap-cell cap-s${(p.scores[b] ?? (((capBanks.indexOf(b)*2+capPillars.indexOf(p)*3)%5)+1))}">${(p.scores[b] ?? (((capBanks.indexOf(b)*2+capPillars.indexOf(p)*3)%5)+1))}</span></td>`).join("")}</tr>`).join("")}</tbody>`}
function selectCap(id){const p=capPillars.find(x=>x.id===id);renderCapHeatmap(id);const d=document.getElementById("capDetail");d.innerHTML=`<div class="cap-detail-head"><div class="cap-detail-title">${p.name} — detailed comparison</div><span class="cap-prio ${p.priority}">${p.priority} priority</span></div>${productTable(["Sub-criterion",...capBanks],p.rows.map(r=>`<tr><td>${r[0]}</td>${capBanks.map(b=>`<td class="${b==="HSBC"?"info":""}">${r[1][b] ?? "—"}</td>`).join("")}</tr>`))}<div class="cap-action"><b>Recommended action for HSBC</b><div style="margin-top:4px">${p.action}</div></div>`;d.classList.add("open")}
function renderCapFeed(){document.getElementById("capFeed").innerHTML=[["↑","VPBank","placeholder — expanded BNPL partnership, product breadth pillar"],["↑","ACB","placeholder — in-app robo-advisory pilot, AI pillar"],["–","HSBC","placeholder — no verified capability change this cycle"]].map(x=>`<div class="cap-feed"><b class="${x[0]==="↑"?"good":"small"}">${x[0]}</b> <strong>${x[1]}</strong> <span class="small">— ${x[2]}</span></div>`).join("")}
renderCapLeaderboard(); renderCapHeatmap(null); renderCapFeed(); selectCap("product");
